<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">MY RITUALS</view><view class="title">护理卡包</view><view class="subtitle">每一张卡的次数、实付和规则都独立保留。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在加载卡包…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="retry">重试</button></view><view wx:if="{{ready&&!cards.length}}" class="empty">卡包还是空的，购买后会立即发卡。</view><view wx:for="{{cards}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="heading">{{item.name}}</view><view class="tag">{{item.statusText}}</view></view><view class="amount">{{item.remaining}}<text class="muted"> / {{item.total}} 次</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.service_name}} · 实付 ¥{{item.paidText}}</view><button class="secondary" data-url="/pages/card-detail/index?id={{item.id}}" bindtap="go">查看明细与退卡规则</button></view></view>
